:math:`(a_0*b_0 \times a_1*b_1 \times \dots \times a_n*b_n)` tensor with the following entries:

.. math::
    (\text{input} \otimes \text{other})_{k_0, k_1, \dots, k_n} =
        \text{input}_{i_0, i_1, \dots, i_n} * \text{other}_{j_0, j_1, \dots, j_n},

